1+ year of team leadership experience; 
Experience communicating with international partners and C-level stakeholders; 
Understanding of: online payment systems and integrations, payment funnels and flows, KYC, AML, and compliance procedures, contractual relations and financial processes; 
Proficiency in MS Office, Google Workspace, SimilarWeb, task tracking, and cloud storage tools. 

