RedCore is an international business group that creates technological solutions for digital markets. Our products and services cover fintech, marketing, e-commerce, customer service, communications, and regulatory technologies. 

We are looking for a Product Manager to join our team!

Requirements:
- 2+ years of experience as a Product Manager/Growth Product Manager;
- Experience managing acquisition and funnel products: registration → KYC → first deposit;
- Experience working with performance marketing teams and understanding traffic unit economics;
- Hands-on experience conducting A/B tests and making data-driven decisions;
- Experience working with web/mobile funnels, player onboarding, and CRM-triggered communications;
- Ability to independently formulate hypotheses and drive them to measurable results;
- Experience with analytics tools: Amplitude / Mixpanel / GA4 / Tableau / Power BI;
- Understanding of key product metrics: CR, CAC, CPA, LTV, ROI, retention rate, activation, GGR, NGR.

