- High decision-making speed;
- Ability to work in conditions of uncertainty;
- Prioritization skills and focus on impact;
- Strong communication skills with marketing, analytics, development, and CRM teams;
- Data-driven approach;
- Proactiveness and independence.

Responsibilities:
- Own the user funnel from the first visit to the first deposit;
- Identify and eliminate conversion drop-off points at every stage of the funnel;
- Improve conversion rates between registration, KYC, and first deposit stages;
- Analyze the behavior of new users within the product;
- Build and prioritize the backlog based on data, tests, and user feedback;
- Develop and maintain acquisition metrics systems and dashboards;
- Launch A/B tests and evaluate their effectiveness;
- Work on onboarding, payments UX, and registration UX;
- Optimize the time-to-first-deposit metric;
- Collaborate closely with performance marketing, CRM, BI, and payments teams;
- Create product requirements for the development team;
- Synchronize product changes with marketing and communication campaigns;
- Improve the efficiency of acquisition channels through product enhancements;
- Improve the quality of acquired traffic;
- Influence CAC through conversion optimization.

