Altum Software is looking for a Prompt Engineer for whom "close enough" is never close enough.
This isn't an "AI enthusiast" role. It's a hands-on position where you design, test, and iterate on prompts that directly shape the quality of AI-powered products — for our clients and our own internal workflows.
If you like finding the exact phrasing that makes a system behave correctly — and you're obsessive about the difference between "almost right" and "exactly right" — read on.

Who we are: Altum is a Ukrainian software and website development house. We build human-centered digital products for startups and mid-sized businesses, and support digital agencies from the US and Western Europe. No mediocrity, no passengers — only people who take ownership and care about doing things well.

