Design and refine prompts for AI features across client products and internal tools;
Build and maintain prompt libraries — structured, versioned, reusable;
Test systematically: document inputs, outputs, failure cases, and improvements;
Work closely with developers, PMs, and designers to integrate AI into product flows;
Research and apply new techniques — chain-of-thought, few-shot, RAG-adjacent approaches;
Translate vague business requirements into precise model instructions;
Track how prompts perform over time and iterate based on results.

