Configure, test, and troubleshoot smart devices and connected hardware systems;
Support testing and validation of mobile applications and SDK integrations across Android and iOS platforms;
Support reproducing and investigating software/hardware integration issues;
Work with physical devices in a lab/test environment;
Analyze requirements and help validate technical flows and integrations;
Create and maintain technical and testing documentation;
Collaborating closely with developers to identify and resolve issues;
Support exploratory, integration, and API testing activities;
Support maintaining stable testing and device environments.
Requirements
Some commercial experience in software engineering, mobile development, QA, technical support, or a related technical role;
Understanding of mobile technologies and development concepts;
Hands-on experience with React Native
Familiarity with at least some of the following:SDK integrations,
Kotlin,
Swift;

Interest in IoT systems, smart devices, or hardware/software integrations;
Comfort working with physical devices and technical documentation;
Strong analytical and troubleshooting skills;
Engineering mindset with curiosity about how systems work together;
Good English communication skills.
Additional (good-to-have) skills
