Experience with CI/CD (CircleCI, GitHub Actions);
Basic hands-on experience with hardware setup and configuration (smart home devices, IoT systems, or similar);
Familiarity with keyless entry systems, smart locks, thermostats, or other connected devices;
Comfort working with physical devices in a test environment — setting up, configuring, and troubleshooting hardware based on technical documentation;
Experience with API testing;
Basic understanding of mobile logs and debugging tools.

