Develop the region as an investment cluster with strong scalability potential.

Requirements

Deep understanding of the iGaming B2C operational business;
Proven experience managing multiple business units, brands, or regions;
Hands-on experience in Tier-1 markets;
Strong knowledge of local licensing, payment infrastructure, and marketing models;
Experience with strategic P&L management and budgeting;
Ability to build management structures and reporting systems;
Capability to lead strong CEOs without micromanagement;
Strong analytical and systems thinking, with a results-driven mindset;
Entrepreneurial approach and ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment;
Fluent English for effective communication with an international team.

What We Offer

A strategic, regional leadership role;
Responsibility for a multi-brand investment cluster;
Opportunity to scale the region through launching new projects;
High level of autonomy in decision-making;
Direct interaction with the board and involvement in shaping holding-level strategy;
Access to the full Fidel Group ecosystem: platform, payment infrastructure, marketing, and operational resources;
A dynamic environment with minimal bureaucracy and significant impact on the business.

