— Take Terraform and Kubernetes to the next level of maturity: modular IaC architecture, standardized deployments, autoscaling — ensuring every release is predictable and reliable;
— Build a full observability system: metrics, logs, traces, alerting — so the team can proactively monitor system health instead of reacting after issues occur;
— Strengthen security practices: access management, secrets handling, protection from external threats — and make security an integral part of the engineering culture;
— Optimize data infrastructure — ensuring stable and efficient pipelines for analytics and business decision-making;
— Create platform templates for new services — so product teams can focus on features instead of infrastructure;
— Work across three core business domains — Product, Growth/Marketing, and Payments — building solutions that scale the entire business, not just individual teams.

