— GCP — projects, networking, services, access management;
— Terraform — infrastructure as code, modules, state management;
— CI/CD — building and maintaining pipelines;
— Observability — monitoring, logging, alerting (Prometheus/Grafana or similar);
— Security — access control, secrets management, protection from external threats;
— Ability to write production-level code — not just scripts (Bash/Python), but also capable of contributing to backend (Node.js/TypeScript) to solve engineering challenges;
— Ownership mindset — proactively identifying risks, driving solutions, and thinking in terms of business impact;
— Actively using AI tools in your workflow to move faster and think broader.

