Project Description:
Luxoft LMD - Learning Management and Development - is a unit within the Talent Acquisition & Management of the DXC Luxoft Company. Being a part of the global company, our main scope is to provide all kinds of learning opportunities for our employees in 29 countries all over the world, as well as for external participants in the training sessions when it is required. Instructor-led online classes globally organized are the LMD key learning services, though in some of our historical locations such as Ukraine, Poland, Romania and India we still have ready-for-use classroom environments and upon request, we conduct training sessions in class.

