Hraymo is a product game development company creating slot games for the global market. We focus on building visually strong and engaging in-game experiences for players worldwide.

We are looking for a Senior 2D Designer who will create in-game visual elements for slot games: logos, pop-ups, symbols, frames, UI elements and other in-game graphics.

The role works within an established visual style and art direction.
This is not a marketing or promo design role — the focus is on in-game production design for slot games.

